msgid "Migrating to RESTEasy Reactive"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Migrating from RESTEasy Classic to RESTEasy Reactive is straightforward in "
"most cases, however there are a few cases that require some attention.\n"
"This document provides a list of issues users attempting the migration "
"should be aware of."
msgstr ""

msgid "Server"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The server part of RESTEasy Reactive (`quarkus-resteasy-reactive` and its "
"dependencies) provide an implementation of the JAX-RS specification, but "
"leverage Quarkus' build time processing\n"
"and the unified I/O model provided by Vert.x."
msgstr ""

msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The following table matches the legacy RESTEasy dependencies with the new "
"RESTEasy Reactive ones."
msgstr ""

msgid "Legacy"
msgstr ""

msgid "RESTEasy Reactive"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-reactive`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-jackson`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-reactive-jackson`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-jsonb`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-reactive-jsonb`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-jaxb`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-reactive-jaxb`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-qute`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus-resteasy-reactive-qute`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Annotations"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"RESTEasy Reactive does not support the various custom annotation under the "
"`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations` package."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The following table matches the legacy RESTEasy annotations with the new "
"RESTEasy Reactive ones."
msgstr ""

msgid "Comments"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.PathParam`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.reactive.RestPath`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This annotation is not necessary when the path part matches the method "
"parameter name"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.QueryParam`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.reactive.RestQuery`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.FormParam`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.reactive.RestForm`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.HeaderParam`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.reactive.RestHeader`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.CookieParam`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.reactive.RestCookie`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.jboss.resteasy.annotations.jaxrs.MatrixParam`"
msgstr ""

